nics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp &amp; Rest</strong> \u2013 Set up your own campsites, cook meals, and gather resources to sustain your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every path you take reveals new stories, mysteries, and hidden wonders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong> \u2013 Let the environment be your guide as you navigate without distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey Without Limits</strong> \u2013 No rush, no pressure\u2014just the freedom to explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.poster.avif?t=1770065702\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.webm?t=1770065702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.mp4?t=1770065702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take the first step on your unforgettable journey?</p>","developers":["FreeMind S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/607f81fdc8c368d13943099c59a2c53465c3c464/header.jpg?t=1770065702","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618320/857039/3c78b990ef806f19f29e4b7f05e90828eddfaebf/1750453